<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-N.TRANSVAAL 134-4 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUAS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-N.TRANSVAAL 134-4 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUAS.</headline>
<dateline>KIMBERLEY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Transvaal were 134 for four from 62 overs at tea having been invited to bat by Griqualand West on the first day of their Supersport Series match in  Kimberley on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Northern Transvaal 134-4, 62 overs (Andre Seymore 69 not out) against Griqualand West</p>
